{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4f5ee0d12d299b103ab2a161cbccf375a8490b96e78016bd23e268cdbc0c3000", "ja": "（今日は、真たちが出演する映画の撮影日。\nそろそろ本番だが……）", "zh": "（今天是真她们出演的电影开拍的日子。\n差不多要正式开拍了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8eb4621e10d81f520a57f9923c8c7f87665e69e4165ab994b052d690f1933cc2", "ja": "真、準備はできたか？", "zh": "真，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "20bd2b37fbe08fa9dafc54e6b2bbace8dfe876e4a0b02c1fb74053dd7bab2bea", "ja": "ファイナルデイ様っ！？", "zh": "最终日大人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "ef10da92ade0a1ef1c5afb74877d010203cebfc70d4619f49e47b168b9288a87", "ja": "……ってなんだ、{$P$}かぁ。", "zh": "……原来是{$P$}啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1004_p", "source_sha256": "18fa27864a48c80295339987e4fea10c9a2af22a773fe79c967ffd0040e7a12a", "ja": "はは、役が板についてきたな。", "zh": "哈哈，越来越像模像样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "85d8dc056c9e8133bd904ae0718fad33b81b448e5f09128e017444e69acc3f78", "ja": "そうですか？\nへへっ……役作りを頑張った甲斐がありました！", "zh": "是这样吗？\n嘿嘿……努力塑造角色果然没有白费！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "4d1624bccb7b30700ee1feb4bb847b3cc8883218fe45fd309222c655337dce18", "ja": "ベルベットの気持ちを理解するのに、\n春香や美希たちにも協力してもらいましたからね。", "zh": "为了理解天鹅绒的心情，我还请春香、美希她们帮了忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "f594583f346b96b7c8cfbd89adcbd2e66c173c01779feae4887bc9315e3de288", "ja": "千早や、エミリー……手伝ってくれたみんなの\nためにも、中途半端な演技は出来ません！", "zh": "为了千早、艾米莉……以及所有帮助过我的人，我不能拿出半吊子的演技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3f13e59c7b30308ffc119298ebce75fa72517fae1c8a66912a399d2ba7516932", "ja": "そうだな。その調子で撮影も頑張ろう、真！\n……いや、ベルベットって呼んだ方がいいかな？", "zh": "对，就保持这个状态，拍摄也加油吧，真！\n……不，叫你“贝尔贝特”会不会更好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "9ccdd813e83a494d9d6c85af758a1dcf3d2e03e13547828be8666eab31dd6246", "ja": "あはは……{$P$}にそう呼ばれると、\n少しくすぐったいですね！", "zh": "啊哈哈……被{$P$}这么叫，\n感觉有点痒痒的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "c3aafb54cc2167f63a67373af23c738aec1e36e88847c8550a50cd711a83b063", "ja": "でももし、{$P$}がこの映画の\n世界にいたら、どんな役になるんだろう？", "zh": "不过，要是{$P$}也在这部电影的世界里，会饰演什么样的角色呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "505e8fdbb509865c31c438ab07c29f0070c2e64e4ee871d3674c9a640bf08817", "ja": "俺か？　うーん……。\n俺はまあ、エキストラの一般人かな？", "zh": "是我吗？嗯……我嘛，应该就是个演路人的群众演员吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "c752dfe5d6346a17f654aad3f58285da212f555c98d72c92137e5c727f0bac4f", "ja": "それじゃダメですよ！　……そうだっ！　ボクが\n特攻隊長だから……直属の参謀なんて、どうですか？", "zh": "这样可不行！……对了！既然我是冲锋队长……那您来当我的直属参谋，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "635f396daa4e03e3b5aa82484f9ca4bb853bafa5427f9d3bc060f58eb64c9907", "ja": "武闘派なベルベットをそばで支える参謀役！\n{$P$}にピッタリだと思うんです！", "zh": "作为武斗派天鹅绒的军师，在身边辅佐她！\n我觉得{$P$}一定很合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cc61d404db4f957c37165e3bd0065038a7fc3d5da342d2d3d758418f2e7a545f", "ja": "なるほどな。今の仕事に通じるものがありそうだ。", "zh": "原来如此。感觉和现在的工作有相通之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "31a18eafaa9d9e258fba65744e13f689a02b44b857d894997e67af409518821a", "ja": "ですよね！　お互いの背中を預けあいながら、\nファイナルデイ様のために戦うふたり……。", "zh": "就是啊！彼此托付后背，为了ファイナルデイ大人而战的两个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "83890899f160e00898b56f81d1c736143ee7b2786a51dae2b6a9f58c7c7af62a", "ja": "無敵のコンビ結成！　と思った矢先に、ボクを庇って、\n参謀は大怪我を……！　{$P$}っ！", "zh": "刚组成无敌搭档！就在这时，为了保护我，军师却身受重伤……{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "5f0022e54e9299647a756e6379fe3c03f5a3204459d4c9d963f4800c1b392e4f", "ja": "なーんて、へへっ♪\nでも『無敵のコンビ』っていうのは、今と同じですね！", "zh": "开玩笑的，嘿嘿♪  \n不过，被称为“无敌组合”这一点，和现在一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1019_p", "source_sha256": "bbe8c2563a5d299c4d0066b77133eb4d69c1b627c73ca1b7e7a2e4dcaa199855", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\nおっと。真、そろそろスタンバイの時間……。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。\n哎呀。真，差不多该准备上场了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "4fef32239dc74e3a583fafbfc0bb06bcd82425b041644139e37705c027d5a107", "ja": "違いますよ、{$P$}！\nそこは参謀っぽく言ってくれないと！", "zh": "不是这样的，{$P$}！你得用参谋的口吻来说才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5e5a7a0e9e6849c7d9c14c24c0f96c7ee85e6140331fc9b8cda71f794dd89048", "ja": "参謀っぽくか……よし。\n『時間だ。ベルベット、出られるか？』", "zh": "要用参谋的口吻说啊……好。\n\n“时间到了。贝尔贝特，能出发吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "2d3bb813bc959f358dcfd2dea9ad5df33d884ca1341593df14e703b6d975016b", "ja": "『当たり前だ。全てはファイナルデイ様のために……。\n行くぞ、付いてこい！』", "zh": "『那是当然。全都是为了终焉之日大人……。\n走，跟上！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0114_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "9e4a44d41205ec8be8eaeca6ded44df2c8a1437438be67941a9991975ee44f95", "ja": "……へへっ！　気合入ってきました！\nこれで今日の撮影も成功、間違いなしですね！", "zh": "……嘿嘿！干劲上来了！\n这样一来，今天的拍摄也绝对会大获成功呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
